HOW TO RUN - MySQL Workbench

1. Install Java JDK 17+ and MySQL Workbench
2. Open MySQL Workbench and connect to Local instance
3. Create Database: CREATE DATABASE healthfirst_db;
4. Import Database: 
   - Server > Data Import > Import from Self-Contained File
   - Select file: database/healthfirst_db.sql
   - Select Target Schema: healthfirst_db > Start Import
5. Open NetBeans > Run Project (F6) OR double click dist/HealthFirst_PIMS.jar
6. Login using credentials above

FEATURES

- Role-Based Access Control (Admin / Cashier)
- Medicine Inventory Management
- Supplier Management
- POS Billing System
- Sales, Expiry & Low Stock Reports

EXECUTABLE

- Runnable JAR: dist/HealthFirst_PIMS.jar
- Executable EXE: dist/HealthFirst_PIMS.exe